WEBVTT

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling, open up your eyes!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling me wo akete

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
It is in this world's evil den

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
Kono yo no aku no soukutsu de

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
You shall receive a rare heart

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
Tsuibamareru kokoro hoshikute

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Escaping is impossible

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Nige mo dekinu

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
My imprisoned, pale-faced prince

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
Yuuhei no souhaku no ouji yo

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
I am a goddess

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
Watashi ga megami

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Kami-chama Karin

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Mini-Goddess Karin

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
In this ward, you have to poach everything

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
Subete wa mitsuryouku

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
With a hidden snare

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
Usumoreta wana ni

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
If you entrap them

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
Hamerareru no nara

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
You'll want to destroy them too…

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
Konagona ni kudaite hoshii wa

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
To die from natural causes or imcompetence

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
Shi ni itaranu yamai

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
It's all poison to your heart

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
Shinzou ni ha pawazon

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
A rose melting in the flames of purgatory

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
Rengoku no homura de zero kara

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Let's redeem this world…

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Saisei shimashou

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
A black dahlia in the nightless city's sky

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
Fuyoru no sora de kuroi daria

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
A lost delusion, a falling reality

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
Shisuru mousou ochiru genjitsu

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Struggling in hell like an ant

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Mogake ari jigoku

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling, give me your voice!

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling koe agete

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
For right now, our limits will have to change

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
Kono ima sashichigaeru hodo

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
If we want for the most important thing

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
Daiji na mono ga hoshii no nara

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Discover the result of your prayers

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Inori wa hatete

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Your princess is dying in prison

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Rougoku de shouten no himegimi

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
You are such a devil…

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
Anata ga maou

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Hate's fist and grief's wounds, too

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Ikari no ken mo nageki no kizu mo

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Dissolving, vanishing, unraveling, passing away, without a trace

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Atokata mo naku tokete kiete chitte utakata

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:35.100
The Present is a Mysterious Ring

00:03:01.590 --> 00:03:02.920
We finally meet.

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:52.180
Nii-san…

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:20.290
How long do you plan to sleep, Karin?!

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:25.840
The new school term starts today.

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:28.340
Didn't I tell you we were restarting early morning practice?!

00:04:29.800 --> 00:04:32.470
Let me sleep a little more.

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:35.640
Yeah, we're still sleepy.

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:37.310
You morons!

00:04:39.230 --> 00:04:42.150
Kazune-kun doesn't show any mercy.

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:44.360
Wake up already!

00:04:46.230 --> 00:04:47.940
Geez, I get it!

00:04:53.280 --> 00:04:57.950
I'm sorry, but my muscles caught a slight cold, so I'll skip training.

00:04:58.240 --> 00:04:59.120
What the heck?

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:03.630
I know! Why don't you train with Himeka-chan?

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:06.340
Himeka-chan's muscles are looking forward to it!

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:06.960
Right?

00:05:07.210 --> 00:05:08.710
And so, it's been decided.

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:10.720
Hey, Karin!

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:14.390
Himeka, what's wrong?

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:18.770
Geez, you're still spaced out from summer vacation as well, aren't you?

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:27.480
That stupid Kazune-kun!

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:30.030
He made me remember things when he came that close.

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:40.330
I can't face Kazune-kun like this!

00:05:40.910 --> 00:05:43.080
Karin-chan, your face is all red.

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:45.710
Maybe you really do have a slight cold.

00:05:46.210 --> 00:05:48.590
I'm fine, it's nothing.

00:05:56.050 --> 00:05:56.970
Mornin'.

00:05:57.720 --> 00:05:59.260
Huh? Where's Karin?

00:05:59.640 --> 00:06:02.640
Good morning, Kazune-chan.

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:04.810
What's with that arrow?

00:06:05.270 --> 00:06:08.770
Ah, I wonder…

00:06:08.770 --> 00:06:14.280
<u>Short letter:</u> I'm going ahead, adieu… Karin

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:14.280
It looks like Karin-chan went ahead.

00:06:15.660 --> 00:06:18.160
I wonder what's wrong.

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:24.790
We even had Karin-chan's favorite, eel curry, for breakfast.

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:26.330
Karin.

00:06:36.550 --> 00:06:37.760
Kirio-chan.

00:06:38.430 --> 00:06:40.600
Are you okay, Himeka?

00:06:41.640 --> 00:06:44.640
I had… a dream.

00:06:45.190 --> 00:06:46.140
A dream?

00:06:46.140 --> 00:06:47.020
Yes.

00:06:47.480 --> 00:06:50.570
A dream where I met a girl I've never met before.

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:55.280
It sure was a strange dream.

00:06:55.820 --> 00:06:56.910
But…

00:06:57.660 --> 00:07:00.660
It was somewhat nostalgic.

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:03.240
It's okay, just get some rest.

00:07:18.130 --> 00:07:20.300
Her condition isn't all that good.

00:07:21.390 --> 00:07:22.600
I know.

00:07:23.100 --> 00:07:24.810
Summer vacation is over.

00:07:24.810 --> 00:07:27.230
We now have more chances to target Kujyou and the others.

00:07:27.230 --> 00:07:30.190
We have to think up a plan, and-

00:07:30.190 --> 00:07:32.610
Nii-san, leave it to me.

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:33.320
What?

00:07:34.730 --> 00:07:35.780
I'll do it.

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:39.860
For some reason, your aura is so different today!

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:42.410
So, do you finally feel like doing it?

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:46.250
It's all for your sake.

00:07:46.370 --> 00:07:48.710
Kirika!

00:07:48.920 --> 00:07:51.790
I'm really touched by what you're doing!

00:07:52.170 --> 00:07:55.210
I'm so happy!

00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:06.810
Good morning!

00:08:07.430 --> 00:08:09.600
Good morning, Hanazono-san!

00:08:11.770 --> 00:08:13.110
Good morning, Karin-chan.

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:15.480
You sure are early today.

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:19.530
I thought I shouldn't be late at the start of the new term.

00:08:20.240 --> 00:08:22.120
Karin-chan, what happened?

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:23.870
You must have a fever.

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:25.200
No, I don't.

00:08:25.790 --> 00:08:28.540
Isn't Kazune-kun with you?

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:32.210
I think he'll be here any second.

00:08:32.210 --> 00:08:35.340
Did you get into a fight with Kazune-kun or something?

00:08:35.340 --> 00:08:37.260
That's not it.

00:08:37.260 --> 00:08:40.340
Oh yeah, I brought some Hawaiian treats!

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:42.760
Have some from the countryside too!

00:08:42.760 --> 00:08:44.220
Ah! That looks delicious!

00:08:44.220 --> 00:08:46.310
Let's eat!

00:08:50.810 --> 00:08:54.230
Did you visit family or something during the summer vacation?

00:08:54.610 --> 00:08:57.730
Ah… I don't have any family.

00:08:59.280 --> 00:09:02.860
I was in a traffic accident when I was young.

00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:06.370
My parents died back then.

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:13.080
When I went to England, professor Kujyou saved me from the verge of death.

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:16.130
Kazune-kun's father…

00:09:16.670 --> 00:09:18.420
These treats sure are delicious!

00:09:20.550 --> 00:09:23.840
I'm sorry for asking you weird questions.

00:09:24.590 --> 00:09:28.850
I don't have any parents either, so maybe we can help each other.

00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:32.350
If you need someone to talk to, come to me.

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:36.190
Just kidding.

00:09:36.730 --> 00:09:37.980
Did you feel sorry for me?

00:09:38.900 --> 00:09:40.990
Talking to you is fun.

00:09:41.530 --> 00:09:45.200
Too bad you're Kazune-kun's lover.

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:47.120
M-Micchi!

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:48.830
Good morning.

00:10:02.550 --> 00:10:04.180
Is something the matter, nii-san?

00:10:04.760 --> 00:10:05.680
Ah, no.

00:10:06.340 --> 00:10:08.600
I might be a little tired.

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:09.890
I might have stamped too many papers.

00:10:10.680 --> 00:10:12.430
Just take it easy, nii-san.

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:15.520
You can't do anything anyway.

00:10:15.520 --> 00:10:17.560
Don't get in my way.

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:34.000
Kazune-kun.

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:43.380
I tried my best to act normally ever since I heard that confession.

00:10:44.050 --> 00:10:46.050
But it's starting to worry me again!

00:10:46.590 --> 00:10:48.550
This is bad!

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:53.430
Karin!

00:10:58.730 --> 00:11:00.980
You're in the archery club?

00:11:01.480 --> 00:11:04.570
No. I was in one in grade school though.

00:11:05.110 --> 00:11:07.160
Now, I just practice when I need to focus.

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:08.910
They let me practice sometimes.

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:13.910
I researched a lot concerning Nishikiyori's ring, but…

00:11:14.370 --> 00:11:15.790
I didn't learn anything.

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:17.250
I see.

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:21.750
The chance that we'll bump into Karasuma has increased since summer vacation has ended.

00:11:22.460 --> 00:11:24.340
We have to be careful again.

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:25.840
Yeah.

00:11:27.430 --> 00:11:30.430
You… sure don't seem happy.

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:33.930
You were acting strange this morning.

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:38.100
I'll listen to whatever you might have bugging you.

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:40.650
Though you might not like talking to a boy.

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:42.270
Kazune-kun.

00:11:42.770 --> 00:11:45.400
But if you don't want to, I don't mind.

00:11:46.030 --> 00:11:48.030
You're worried about me.

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:49.700
Of course I am!

00:11:50.740 --> 00:11:51.870
Thanks.

00:11:53.990 --> 00:11:54.990
Cheer up.

00:11:55.620 --> 00:11:56.040
Okay.

00:11:56.960 --> 00:11:59.120
I feel relaxed when you're happy.

00:12:01.210 --> 00:12:07.420
I know if I'm not around Himeka would have trouble…

00:12:09.680 --> 00:12:14.220
But you're strong, so you'll be fine if I leave you alone a bit.

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:18.640
Karin, what's wrong?

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:22.150
It's nothing, I'm perfectly fine!

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:24.570
I see, I'm glad.

00:12:24.570 --> 00:12:26.030
Thanks.

00:12:26.360 --> 00:12:27.940
Well then, I'm going to change.

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:33.160
Damn it!

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:36.490
Stupid Kazune! Stupid Kazune! Stupid Kazune! Stupid…

00:12:38.370 --> 00:12:39.660
Kirika-senpai.

00:12:40.080 --> 00:12:42.830
You're energetic as usual, Karin-chan.

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:46.420
Are you practicing your harite here?

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:46.420
<u>Harite:</u> Slapping your opponent with an open hand in sumo wrestling.

00:12:46.630 --> 00:12:48.010
Y-Yes.

00:12:49.380 --> 00:12:51.470
What are you doing here, Kirika-senpai?

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:53.300
I was looking for you.

00:12:53.890 --> 00:12:54.930
Looking for me?

00:12:55.310 --> 00:12:57.770
If it's okay with you, why don't we go home together?

00:12:58.600 --> 00:12:59.560
Let's go on a date.

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:10.740
Is it grilled
eel over rice?

00:13:11.820 --> 00:13:14.280
I am God!

00:13:17.990 --> 00:13:19.240
You moron.

00:13:18.220 --> 00:13:19.240
It's a croquette!

00:13:58.580 --> 00:14:01.410
Just like in my dream.

00:14:46.670 --> 00:14:47.330
What's this?

00:14:48.330 --> 00:14:51.170
I've never seen this reaction before.

00:15:11.860 --> 00:15:16.150
I wonder why Kirika-senpai asked me out all of a sudden.

00:15:17.160 --> 00:15:21.200
But I should be happy that I'm able to go on a date with Kirika-senpai.

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:27.120
I know, why don't we go and have some ice cream?

00:15:32.460 --> 00:15:34.550
Here you go, eel-flavoured ice cream.

00:15:35.590 --> 00:15:37.050
Thank you very much.

00:15:38.840 --> 00:15:39.720
It's good.

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:07.540
Senpai, how did you know that I like eel-flavoured ice cream?

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:13.460
I know everything about you.

00:16:14.500 --> 00:16:16.010
Because I've always been watching you.

00:16:18.220 --> 00:16:20.090
Hey, it's melting.

00:16:25.220 --> 00:16:26.930
Karin-chan, what's wrong?

00:16:27.350 --> 00:16:29.140
It's nothing.

00:16:37.240 --> 00:16:41.360
Actually, there's something that I want to give you today.

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:43.320
It's this ring.

00:16:45.370 --> 00:16:46.540
It's amazing.

00:16:51.170 --> 00:16:54.750
Are you giving this to me?

00:16:54.750 --> 00:16:57.590
I'm sure it'll suit you.

00:16:58.300 --> 00:16:59.590
I want to give this to you as a present.

00:17:00.220 --> 00:17:01.380
The ring?

00:17:01.380 --> 00:17:02.800
Will you accept it?

00:17:03.760 --> 00:17:04.350
Yes!

00:17:06.060 --> 00:17:11.770
Getting a ring from Kirika-senpai… it's just like a dream.

00:17:12.270 --> 00:17:14.150
Well, I'll put it on for you.

00:17:22.820 --> 00:17:24.740
I didn't think the branch would snap.

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:30.040
What are you thinking?

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:33.630
What is that ring?

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:35.290
What were you planning to do to Karin?

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:38.250
Hey, are you okay, Karin?

00:17:39.710 --> 00:17:40.380
Can you stand?

00:17:41.050 --> 00:17:43.640
Why are you getting in our way?

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:47.810
Kirika-senpai finally asked me out.

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:50.980
He finally gave me that ring as a present.

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:54.150
He's exploiting your feelings!

00:17:54.600 --> 00:17:57.860
It's all messed up because of you!

00:17:57.860 --> 00:17:59.280
Are you stupid?

00:17:59.280 --> 00:18:00.610
You don't get it at all!

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:02.280
This is exactly why girls are-

00:18:03.740 --> 00:18:06.570
Kazune-kun, you idiot!

00:18:09.700 --> 00:18:12.370
Kazune-kun… you idiot.

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:15.580
Wait up!

00:18:21.010 --> 00:18:22.340
Ego sumo deus.

00:18:27.550 --> 00:18:30.600
Can you see me in this form?

00:18:33.100 --> 00:18:38.650
If you can see my transformed state, then you must be one of Karasuma's allies.

00:18:44.650 --> 00:18:45.860
As expected.

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:53.290
What is that ring?

00:18:57.460 --> 00:19:00.630
That isn't a normal ring, is it?

00:19:01.750 --> 00:19:02.670
Do you think I'll let you get away?

00:19:03.090 --> 00:19:04.630
Sagitta Solis!

00:19:11.260 --> 00:19:13.350
I'm sure I said you wouldn't get away.

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:47.220
What is that?

00:19:55.640 --> 00:19:56.600
The ring is…

00:20:06.320 --> 00:20:07.530
It can't be…

00:20:10.200 --> 00:20:12.740
What is that ring?

00:20:13.490 --> 00:20:15.160
It's father's memento.

00:20:16.040 --> 00:20:19.460
And it's a weapon that can defeat you!

00:21:15.390 --> 00:21:17.100
Stop it, it's dangerous!

00:21:20.770 --> 00:21:24.400
No!!!

00:21:55.760 --> 00:21:57.220
What was that?

00:22:01.940 --> 00:22:03.980
Ki-Kirika-senpai!

00:22:04.350 --> 00:22:06.360
Senpai, are you okay?

00:22:06.360 --> 00:22:08.020
Hang in there!

00:22:08.690 --> 00:22:09.980
He's injured.

00:22:10.490 --> 00:22:12.200
I have to help him.

00:22:14.950 --> 00:22:15.530
Boing?

00:22:22.460 --> 00:22:25.710
Senpai has breasts!

00:22:27.000 --> 00:22:30.210
Which means that Kirika-senpai is a…

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:45.530
Saa, ikou yo shiranai michi

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:45.530
Come, let's go down an unknown path.

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:53.700
Sugu kieru mayotetteta

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:53.700
It will soon dissappear, and we'll be lost.

00:22:54.830 --> 00:23:01.540
Hamikaze  sasotte

00:22:54.830 --> 00:23:01.540
Invited by the humming wind…

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:09.050
Sasayaku kuchi no hou ikutte uta

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:09.050
…that whispered out of my singing mouth.

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:16.270
Sagashiteta mirai soba ni aru

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:16.270
The future you're looking for is right next to you.

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:23.260
Messeeji wa hitotsu kasanaru yo

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:23.260
The messages are all piling up, one by one.

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:32.830
Sora e kabatte tobashite yume o kabatte sakebu yo

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:32.830
I'm going to fly up, protected into the sky and shout my dreams out to the world.

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:41.380
Kimi ni todoke nanairo no michi tokuchuu meeru

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:41.380
So that it'll reach you, my special delivery mail along a rainbow-coloured road.

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:49.380
Hakanai negai demo isshunkai hanatto yo

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:49.380
I won't abandon my fleeting wish, even for a second.

00:23:49.380 --> 00:24:03.050
Kimi ni todoke kono omoi to kimi ni fuiteta kaze wo

00:23:49.380 --> 00:24:03.050
So that my feelings will reach you, through this blowing wind.

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:11.170
Kirika-senpai's Confession
